Dive deep into lucidity in Hawaii June 20-22 with a transformative ocean retreat led by Dr. Johnson: https://deep-lucid-dreaming-video-courses.teachable.com/p/lucid-dreaming-ocean-retreat-hawaii

Enjoy this fabulous conversation between lucid dreaming author Dr. Clare Johnson and Andrew Holecek, a profoundly insightful teacher and one of the foremost modern voices on Dream Yoga. 

Together they go through the first 4 of Andrew’s 9 stages of Dream Yoga, with both sharing their own lucid dreams to fit each category – making this podcast episode uniquely experiential and practical, as well as a great laugh. Time stamps below.

Andrew and Clare talked so long that this conversation has been split into two parts. In part 1, they cover the first 4 stages of Dream Yoga: Stage 1, Fly in your dreams. Stage 2, Walk through walls. Stage 3, Change things. Stage 4, Create frightful situations to work with your fear.

Andrew’s clarity, depth, and lived understanding of Tibetan dream and sleep practices make his teachings both accessible and transformative. He is the author of Dream Yoga, Dreams of Light, and has a new book out soon called Total Eclipse of the Mind. Find out more on https://www.andrewholecek.com

Dive deep with Dr. Clare Johnson's 8 books and lucid video classes or join her for a lucid dreaming ocean retreat, explore at https://www.deepluciddreaming.com

